/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 104 0 R
/E (D'Elia T, Veerapaneni R, Rogers SO. Isolation of microbes from Lake Vostok accretion ice. Appl Environ Microbiol. 2008 Aug;74\(15\):4962-5. doi: 10.1128/AEM.02501-07. Epub 2008 Jun 13. PMID: 18552196; PMCID: PMC2519340. )
/Pg 16 0 R
